cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CHARKHA in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: CHARKHA
abstract: >
  A 0.97B-parameter depth-recurrent hybrid language model (GDN-2 + attention)
  designed to train, fine-tune, and serve on a single 8 GB consumer GPU.
  Includes a custom 65,535-token BPE tokenizer, adaptive test-time compute,
  and an experimental serving scaffold with retrieval, tools, and confidence-gated
  effort escalation.
authors:
  - name: CHARKHA contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/RajKVyas/charkha
license: MIT
type: software
